    "title": "<p>Classification of neuroendocrine tumours (NETs) of the lung and thymus</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Dr. Stefano La Rosa",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 497.25pt; margin-left: -7.1pt; border-collapse: collapse; \" border=\"0\" width=\"663\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 76.8pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"102\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Terminology</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 107.5pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"143\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Differentiation</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.45pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"95\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Grade</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 162.0pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"216\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Diagnostic histological criteria</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 79.5pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"106\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Terminology proposal</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 76.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"102\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Typical carcinoid</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 107.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"143\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Well differentiated</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"95\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Low</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 162.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"216\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\" tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \"><span style=\"\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Neuroendocrine morphology</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\" tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \"><span style=\"\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>&lt;&nbsp;2&nbsp;mitoses&nbsp;/ 2&nbsp;mm<sup>2</sup></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\" tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \"><span style=\"\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>No necrosis</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 79.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"106\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">NET G1</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 76.8pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"102\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Atypical carcinoid</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 107.5pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"143\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Well differentiated</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.45pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"95\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Intermediate</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 162.0pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"216\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\" tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \"><span style=\"\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; \">Neuroendocrine morphology</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\" tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \"><span style=\"\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; \">2&ndash;10&nbsp;mitoses&nbsp;/ 2&nbsp;mm<sup>2&nbsp;a</sup></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\" tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \"><span style=\"\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; \">Necrosis<sup>a</sup></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 79.5pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"106\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">NET G2</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup><span style=\"\">a</span></sup><span style=\"\">One</span> or both should be present.</p>",
