    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; \" border=\"0\" width=\"931\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.5pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"161\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Syndrome/condition</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0cm; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Gene(s)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Location(s)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 400.2pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"534\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Histopathology and immunohistochemistry</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 126.55pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 126.55pt;\" width=\"161\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Multiple endocrine neoplasia type&nbsp;1</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 126.55pt;\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\">MEN1</em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 126.55pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Gastric</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Pancreatic</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Duodenal</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Pulmonary</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Thymic</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 400.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 126.55pt;\" width=\"534\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Global menin loss</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Multifocal NETs arising in neuroendocrine cell hyperplasia</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Gastric:</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 24.05pt; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \"><span style=\"\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>ECL-cell and parietal cell hyperplasia</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 24.05pt; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \"><span style=\"\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Multifocal (type&nbsp;2) ECL-cell NETs</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Pancreatic:</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 24.05pt; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \"><span style=\"\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Glucagon most frequent in pancreatic NETs</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 24.05pt; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \"><span style=\"\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Islet dysplasia, ductuloinsular complexes, islet peliosis</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 24.05pt; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \"><span style=\"\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Pancreatic neuroendocrine <span style=\"\">microtumours<sup>b</sup></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Duodenal/pancreatic:</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 24.05pt; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \"><span style=\"\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Gastrinomas and plurihormonal NETs</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"161\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Multiple endocrine neoplasia type&nbsp;4</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\"><span style=\"color: black; \">CDKN1B</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Gastric</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Pancreatic</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Duodenal</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Pulmonary</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Thymic</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 400.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"534\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Global loss of nuclear p27 expression</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 24.85pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 24.85pt;\" width=\"161\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Von Hippel&ndash;Lindau syndrome</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 24.85pt;\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\">VHL</em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 24.85pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Pancreatic</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Duodenal</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 400.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 24.85pt;\" width=\"534\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Frequent associated cystic disease</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Multifocal NETs and <span style=\"\">microtumours<sup>b</sup></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Islet dysplasia, ductuloinsular complexes, islet peliosis</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Clear cell and oncocytic cytomorphology</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">PP-expressing NETs are common</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Variably positive for CAIX, &alpha;-inhibin, HIF1&alpha;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 34.8pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 34.8pt;\" width=\"161\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Neurofibromatosis type&nbsp;1 </span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 34.8pt;\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\"><span style=\"color: black; \">NF1</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 34.8pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Pancreatic</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Duodenal (ampullary type)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 400.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 34.8pt;\" width=\"534\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Insulin-producing pancreatic NET</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Somatostatin-producing duodenal D-cell NET with psammoma bodies</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"161\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Mahvash disease</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\">GCGR</em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Pancreatic</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 400.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"534\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Glucagon A-cell hyperplasia to neoplasia progression</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"161\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Familial insulinomatosis</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\"><span style=\"color: black; \">MAFA</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Pancreatic</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 400.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"534\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Insulin B-cell hyperplasia to neoplasia progression</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 107.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 107.2pt;\" width=\"161\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Congenital hyperinsulinism</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 107.2pt;\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\">ABCC8</em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\">KCNJ11</em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\">GCK</em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\">GLUD1</em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\">SLC16A1</em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\">HNF4A</em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\">HADH</em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"\">UPD</span> (11p15)<sup>c</sup></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 107.2pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Pancreatic</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 400.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 107.2pt;\" width=\"534\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Typical form: partial/diffuse islet hyperplasia, nesidioblastosis, <span style=\"\">microtumours<sup>b</sup></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Atypical forms: LINE, islet proliferations related to Beckwith&ndash;Wiedemann syndrome</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 39.6pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 39.6pt;\" width=\"161\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Tuberous sclerosis</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 39.6pt;\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\"><span style=\"color: black; \">TSC1</span></em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\"><span style=\"color: black; \">TSC2</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 39.6pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Pancreatic</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Rectal</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 400.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 39.6pt;\" width=\"534\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Multifocal in pancreas</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Global loss of tuberin or hamartin</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 55.8pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 55.8pt;\" width=\"161\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Familial small bowel NET</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 55.8pt;\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\">IPMK</em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\">SMARCB1</em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"\">Chr</span>&nbsp;18 del</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 55.8pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Ileal</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 400.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 55.8pt;\" width=\"534\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Multifocal EC-cell NETs unassociated with other well-known genetic syndromes</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">No underlying neuroendocrine cell hyperplasia</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"161\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">SDH</span><span style=\"color: black; \">-related familial PGL syndromes</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">SDH genes</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Pancreatic<sup>d</sup></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 400.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"534\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Global loss of SDHB</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"161\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Pacak&ndash;Zhuang syndrome</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>EPAS1</em> (<em style=\"\">HIF2A</em><span style=\"\">)</span><sup>e</sup></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Duodenal</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 400.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"534\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Duodenal somatostatin-producing D-cell NET</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"161\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Lynch syndrome</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\"><span style=\"color: black; \">MLH1</span></em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\"><span style=\"color: black; \">MSH2</span></em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\"><span style=\"color: black; \">MSH6</span></em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\"><span style=\"color: black; \">PMS2</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Pancreatic</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 400.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"534\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Global loss of MLH1, MSH2, MSH6, or PMS2</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.5pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"161\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>DNA repair pathway&ndash;related NENs</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0cm; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\">BRCA2</em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\">CHEK2</em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\">MUTYH</em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\">PALB2</em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\">NTHL1</em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Pancreatic</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Pulmonary</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Thymic</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 400.2pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"534\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Scant morphological data</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><a name=\"_Hlk128646435\"></a><span style=\"\">Chr,</span> chromosome; del, deletion; EC, enterochromaffin; ECL, enterochromaffin-like; LINE, localized islet nuclear enlargement; NEN, neuroendocrine neoplasm; PGL, paraganglioma; UPD, uniparental disomy.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"\"><sup><span style=\"\">a</span></sup><span style=\"\">Data</span> are based on overall experience in adults and children. <sup><span style=\"\">b</span></sup><span style=\"\">Neuroendocrine</span> microtumours (also known as neuroendocrine microadenomas). <sup><span style=\"\">c</span></sup><span style=\"\">A</span> subset of patients without other characteristic mutations harbour mosaic uniparental isodisomy for chromosome 11p15 in association with Beckwith&ndash;Wiedemann syndrome&ndash;related congenital hyperinsulinism. <sup><span style=\"\">d</span></sup><span style=\"\">Single</span> case report of a pancreatic NET. <sup><span style=\"\">e</span></sup><span style=\"\">Often</span> somatic and rarely germline.</span></p>",
